# Reticle verification

When you change CareerVerse UI or client-visible API behavior, verify on the **running** local app with Reticle (MCP) before calling the work done — network status, console errors, visible state — not screenshots alone.

- Dev/localhost only. Never wire Reticle into production or student-facing product UI.
- App connect: `src/app/reticle-dev.tsx` (mounted in root layout in development).
- If no Reticle session: report that; do not invent a pass.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/reticle/SKILL.md`.
